---
hideRelated: true
layout: layout.njk
title: Health Talks
description: Nursing health talks for ANM, GNM and BSc Nursing practical files.
category: Health Talk
---

<div class="category-header">
    <div class="cat-icon">🗣️</div>

    <h1>Health Talks</h1>

    <p class="cat-desc">
        Detailed nursing health talks with introduction, objectives,
        AV aids, content, evaluation questions, references, and health
        education material for ANM, GNM, and BSc Nursing practical files.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="post-list">

{% for post in collections.all | reverse %}

{% if "health-talk/" in post.inputPath %}

    <div class="post-card">

        <div class="post-info">

            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>

            <p class="post-meta">
                {{ post.date.toLocaleDateString('en-IN') }}
            </p>

            <p class="post-desc">
                {{ post.data.description or
                "Detailed nursing health talk for ANM, GNM and BSc Nursing students." }}
            </p>

        </div>

        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="btn">
            Read Health Talk
        </a>

    </div>

{% endif %}

{% endfor %}

</div>
